# Virtualenvs (huge — never belong in an image)
**/.venv
**/venv
**/env

# Python caches / build artifacts
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache

# Node / frontend build artifacts (frontend builds in its own stage)
**/node_modules
frontend/dist

# Notebooks & training/docs not needed at serving time
**/*.ipynb
llm_lab/Dockerfile
llm_lab/Dockerfile.gpu
llm_lab/COLAB_TRAINING.md

# VCS / editor / OS
.git
**/.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
